minios-live (6.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Package the MiniOS 6 build system.
  * Raise the packaging baseline to Debian 12 with debhelper compatibility 13.
  * Add Debian, Ubuntu and Devuan profile and init-system support.
  * Package the current kernel, EFI, Secure Boot, initramfs and persistence
    build workflows.
  * Update runtime dependencies for EFI verification and ISO generation.
  * Treat bundled boot and initramfs ELF files as target payload rather than
    host shared-library dependencies.
  * Install manual pages pre-rendered by Lokit before package creation, without
    invoking Pandoc, po4a or Lokit from the Debian build.
  * Run the package-safe boot, kernel DKMS and shutdown Bats suites plus the
    CondinAPT regression tests during package builds.

 -- crims0n <crims0n@minios.dev>  Sun, 06 Sep 2026 18:45:32 +0300

minios-live (5.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add man pages for minios-live, minios-cmd, condinapt commands
  * Add man page for condinapt-minios integration documentation
  * Implement automatic man page generation from Markdown using pandoc
  * Add po4a support for man page translations (8 languages)
  * Update documentation with system installation paths
  * Add Build-Depends: pandoc, po4a
  * Refactor Makefile for improved package building
  * Add lintian overrides for bootfiles and scripts

 -- crims0n <crims0n@minios.dev>  Thu, 02 Oct 2025 13:40:17 +0300

